# Small fixture load. 100x32 shows Unstaged and the first files; later
# groups sit below the fold, so `until` steps j until those tokens appear.
wait Unstaged
wait a/A approve
wait line 1/
wait   a.txt
until this is old j
until this is new j
until after.txt j

# ? opens help. The title lists the close key; the panel caption names help.
send ?
wait Esc close
gone a/A approve
send Escape
wait a/A approve
gone Esc close
